      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "stronger host-guest binding environment → qst"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] engineer dense and strong multiple CO2 binding sites inside the pores → produces ultrastrong CO2 binding affinity and record-high low-pressure uptake capacity through dense CO2 packing"
