    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] fine-tune MOF throat aperture to about 3.4 Å in an ultra-microporous framework → enables CO2 entry while selectively excluding Xe, N2, and O2, supporting ideal molecular sieving and strong CO2 adsorption"
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparison",
